# What "docker build" is allowed to see. Used by ./Dockerfile.
#
# Start from nothing and let in only the two packages the API needs.
# This keeps secrets (server/.env), timetable files (data/) and databases
# (tmp/, var/, backups/) out of the image, and keeps the build fast.
*
!server
!ingest

# Installed inside the image for Linux; the copies on your computer must not go in.
**/node_modules

# Settings and secrets are given to the container when it starts, never baked in.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Not needed to run the API.
server/test
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
